<title>INDIA: Soccer-China beat India in Nehru Gold Cup 3rd place play-off.</title>
<headline>Soccer-China beat India in Nehru Gold Cup 3rd place play-off.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China beat India 2-1 (halftime 2-1) in the play-off for third place in the Nehru Gold Cup soccer tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>China - Bao Wen Jie 17, Huang Yong 31</p>
<p>India - Baichung Bhutia 36</p>
</text>
